# ☕ Grain & Grow – Coffee House Website
A desktop coffee house website built with HTML5, CSS3 and Bootstrap 5 (no JavaScript), with the same design made in Figma. Pages: Home, Discover, Menu, Product and Cart.
Open `index.html` in Chrome to run it (internet needed for images and Bootstrap). Figma: [https://www.figma.com/design/9f5zybNCNGQSMBq0YuDcP7/cafe?node-id=0-1&t=sfbJP9Qevp0QbkRJ-1]
